              "value": "(move)\n\nTrigger: The cauthooj is the target of a melee\n\nStrike and is adjacent to another enemy that is also within the reach of the melee Strike. The cauthooj nimbly hops aside, redirecting the triggering Strike against the adjacent enemy. The cauthooj Strides up to half its Speed, and this movement does not trigger reactions."
